IMPSC-1138 severity warn short {In scan chain \"%s\" DEF ordered section, buffers or logics following scan instance \"%s\" are corrected to match the netlist.}} {count 2 id IMPSP-2904 severity warn short {option place_detail_filler_gap_effort and place_detail_filler_gap_min_gap will be obsolete from next release and is replaced by place_detail_legalization_inst_gap <site>.}} {count 1 id IMPOPT-7140 severity warn short {The \"set_db opt_hold_cells\" list is empty}} {count 1 id NRIF-80 severity warn short {When route_detail_post_route_swap_via is set to 'multiCut', the post route via swapping step will be performed on all nets, and to double cut vias. To swap to DFM vias based on via weight, please set the option to 'true'.}} {count 1 id NRIF-83 severity warn short {When route_detail_post_route_swap_via is set to 'none', the post route via swapping step will be skipped in all scenarios.}} {count 1 id NRIF-90 severity warn short {Option set_db route_bottom_routing_layer is obsolete. It will continue to work for the current release. To ensure compatibility with future releases, use option set_db design_bottom_routing_layer instead.}} {count 1 id NRIF-91 severity warn short {Option set_db route_top_routing_layer is obsolete. It will continue to work for the current release. To ensure compatibility with future releases, use option set_db design_top_routing_layer instead.}} {count 2 id IMPPSP-1003 severity warn short {Found use of '%s'. This will continue to work in this release; however, it is recommended to use '%s' instead.}} {count 1836 id IMPCTE-290 severity warn short {Could not locate cell %s in any library for view %s.}} {count 1 id TCLCMD-1469 severity warn short {No timing paths found matching the specified criteria. Empty collection returned.}} {count 1 id TCLCMD-1681 severity warn short {The software has performed a full/partial timing reset. All existing timing path and timing point collection references have been invalidated and may no longer be referenced.}}